{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2c5d8789-310f-86a2-b8b2-24be7801eef0",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T15:14:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nora Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:11:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:12:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. I'm on the speaker here, my hands are full, so tell me if you can't hear me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:12:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's about a delivery truck. It sits there idling at dawn, wicked loud, right outside my shop. Five-thirty, quarter of six, engine just running and running."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:12:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. A delivery truck, idling early in the morning. How long has that been happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:12:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since last Thursday. So that's, what, Thursday, Friday, then the weekend, and again yesterday and this morning. Every single day. I'm up anyway at my age, but I don't need it rattling the front window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would get old fast. Do you know which company the truck belongs to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:12:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "White truck, no name I can read from the window. I could get the plate if I stand out there tomorrow, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:12:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help, if it's safe to do so from your doorway. Um, let me think how best to point you. This office can take down the complaint, but I'm not sure we handle the enforcing part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:13:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I wanted to ask. Should I be calling the police non-emergency line instead? I didn't want to bother them, it's not an emergency, but I don't know who does what."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a reasonable thing to ask. For something ongoing like this, the non-emergency line is the right place to report it, and they can note the pattern. I'll also write up your complaint here so it's on record. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:13:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nora Reardon. R-E-A-R-D-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:13:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Nora Reardon. And a callback number, in case someone wants to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:13:48-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0188."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:13:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-eight. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:13:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And listen, I'm new to this end of town, only just opened the shop here, so I don't know how things work yet. I'd appreciate your patience with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Questions are what we're here for. I'll pass your complaint along, and if you get that plate number, give the police line that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:14:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll do that. Thank you, Owen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T15:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Nora. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
